      "message": "No, but you need to manually convert the little-endian values to \u0026 from current endianness - e.g. let version \u003d header.version.from_le()\n\nhttps://doc.rust-lang.org/std/primitive.i32.html#method.from_le\n\nAlso as I recall Rust\u0027s repr(packed) is pretty weird - you can\u0027t make references to the fields - but hopefully that doesn\u0027t get in the way.",
